  "all_ingredients_flat": "corn flour, sorghum flour, chia seed powder, flaxseed powder, cumin seeds, carom seeds, turmeric powder, black pepper, ginger paste, garlic paste, asafetida (hing), mango powder, green chili, Curry Leaves Dry Chatni, carrot, bottle gourd, beetroot, onion, spinach, coriander, potato, plant-based yogurt, ENO",
  "instructions": "Mix all ingredients into a tight dough. Add extra water or flour if needed.\nMake balls with the dough. Then make a hole in the centre to get a donut shape like Sambar Vada.\nSteam them for 20 to 30 minutes. Check with a toothpick or fork. If needed, steam for 5 to 10 minutes more. Optionally bake them for five minutes in an air fryer at 180 C to make them crispy.",
